oming LLMs into your workflow to generate, transform, and analyze code.\n- Chat with teammates, write notes together, and share your screen and project. All included.\n- Zed now speaks WSL. You can open a Linux distro as a first-class “remote” target, edit projects that live inside it.\n- All of Zed’s AI features, including edit predictions and ACP-powered agents, are fully supported on Windows.\n- All Zed extensions now work seamlessly on Windows; no special steps, no caveats.\n- To run on almost all Windows versions, including VMs, we created a new rendering backend based on DirectX 11.","name":"Zed Preview","packageUrl":"https://zed.dev/windows","publisher":"Zed Industries","publisherUrl":"https://zed.dev/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/releases/tag/v1.26.1-pre","tags":["code-editor","developer-tools","editor","text-editor"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://zed.dev/","releaseDate":"2026-10-21","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/releases/tag/v1.26.1-pre","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/z/ZedIndustries/Zed/Preview/1.26.1-pre/ZedIndustries.Zed.Preview.yaml","sha256":"b0cca39209405ddd0f7812abd34f7c0260d5c215e57ae689e746eadd5d6cb4b1"},{"path":"manifests/z/ZedIndustries/Zed/Preview/1.26.1-pre/ZedIndustries.Zed.Preview.installer.yaml","sha256":"068ab038791d5c1084c03ca191ff1b660b460805ef41270b6bf6ce49c6cdaf55"},{"path":"manifests/z/ZedIndustries/Zed/Preview/1.26.1-pre/ZedIndustries.Zed.Preview.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"f414fdddfbb1c5cc51fef5e093256c3e89730c5ad65ff886361f58de9f17d8bd"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.26.1-pre"}